  "description": "<p data-start=\"2586\" data-end=\"2828\">Breng je geluid tot leven met deze <strong data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2669\">Epiphone Valve Junior</strong> buisversterker in <strong data-start=\"2688\" data-end=\"2699\">A-grade</strong> staat. Een krachtige 5-watt Class-A amp die pure, warme buizenklank levert, met minimale sporen van gebruik en volledig werkend.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"2830\" data-end=\"2860\"><strong data-start=\"2830\" data-end=\"2858\">Belangrijkste kenmerken:</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"2861\" data-end=\"3446\">\r\n<li data-start=\"2861\" data-end=\"2966\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2863\" data-end=\"2966\">5 Watt Class A vermogen via EL84 eindbuis; preamp-buis is 12AX7</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"2861\" data-end=\"2966\">\r\n<p data-start=\"2863\" data-end=\"2966\">Speaker: 8-inch Eminence Lady Luck (of vergelijkbaar), ideale respons voor crunch & drive </p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3099\" data-end=\"3212\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3101\" data-end=\"3212\">Uitgangen: 4 / 8 / 16 ohm speaker-outputs aanwezig bij relevante versie </p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3213\" data-end=\"3365\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3215\" data-end=\"3365\">Afwerking & behuizing in zeer goede conditie, via zwart/wit tolex of klassieke grill, zoals origineel geleverd <span class=\"\" data-state=\"closed\"><span class=\"ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]\" data-testid=\"webpage-citation-pill\"><a class=\"flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]! transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out\" href=\"https://www.elderly.com/products/epiphone-valve-junior-130u-221006?srsltid=AfmBOoroTxG28IGEjW3N4d-wXEb2K4MTO1mQ0gt92al_G2aXGaaiRxcE&utm_source=chatgpt.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center\"><span class=\"flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center\"> </span></span></span></a></span></span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"3366\" data-end=\"3446\">\r\n<p data-start=\"3368\" data-end=\"3446\">Compact, krachtig en ideaal voor studio, thuisgebruik of modding liefhebbers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"3448\" data-end=\"3481\">✅ Eén maand garantie inbegrepen</p>",
